Z||000009||Fiero_24||09-15-2001||12:32 PM||||I do not like to laugh at people, but when it comes to STUPID Fiero owners I just cannot help but to let loose a good hard laugh.  I even e-mailed her asking if the door ajar light works well and have not gotten an e-mail back.  The best ones are all those fools that include the word "RARE" in their adds.  Maybe some off these fools are a rare find, but their cars sure are not. Unless they have 3 miles or so on them, then I consider them rare.  There are some rare Fiero's out there, but the adds I am talking about are old beater Fiero's that are falling apart.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sunset_1_1_1.jpg">  <BR>  <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24</A> <BR>1987 GT<p>[This message has been edited by Fiero_24 (edited 09-15-2001).]||||reg||10
